24 **Bit Manipulation Pattern**
**********************************************
🧠 Full Bit Manipulation Roadmap (Interview)

Here are the patterns you MUST learn:

⭐ (1) XOR → Single number
⭐ (2) Bits Count → Single number when others appear 3 times
⭐ (3) XOR + Bit Split → Find 2 unique numbers
⭐ (4) Missing number using XOR
⭐ (5) Find power of 2 using bit
⭐ (6) Count set bits — Brian Kernighan algorithm
⭐ (7) Reverse bits
⭐ (8) Bitmask — subsets generation
⭐ (9) Detect if bit is ON/OFF
⭐ (10) Add numbers without + operator (using XOR + AND)